<title>PORTUGAL: Sonae's property unit to be floated-paper.</title>
<headline>Sonae's property unit to be floated-paper.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-08-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Sonae Imobiliaria, a real estate  unit of Sonae Investimentos, will be floated on the bourse in the  last quarter of the year, Diario de Noticias quoted group chairman  Belmiro de Azevedo as saying.</p>
<p>The newspaper said that the unit's chairman Alvaro Portela had told  it that the float would take the form of a public offer to sell (OPV)  on the bourse.</p>
<p>--Lisbon bureau 3511-3113126</p>
</text>
